    {
      "reviewbody": "lots of crowd noise/talking, your mic's should have been set higher the 5 feet. Go for the other copies much better sound.",
      "reviewtitle": "another let down",
      "reviewer": "LGTR",
      "reviewdate": "2013-12-04 05:23:15",
      "createdate": "2013-12-04 05:23:15",
      "stars": "1"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "Really i dont care what you think but u need to crawl back under your bridge not sure what your deal is bedide your a troll but  if you have the expert equipment then tape the shows and let us hear what you got i myself think it sounds good so if you dont like it dont listen wait for sbd !!! I have an idea of who u are !!!!!!",
      "reviewtitle": "LGTR wheres your pull????i think mine sounds nice !!!!!!",
      "reviewer": "doseofmk",
      "reviewdate": "2013-12-04 07:40:53",
      "createdate": "2013-12-04 07:40:53",
      "stars": "4"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "Felt like another review was needed here to balance things out. Yeah, there's some crowd noise but it was a loud crowd that night. As far as the recording itself, this is definitely the cleanest recordings of the show up on the archive so far and the first one that was clean enough for me to download. Nice job, Danny.",
      "reviewtitle": "Nicely done",
      "reviewer": "Spelaeus",
      "reviewdate": "2013-12-04 10:26:44",
      "createdate": "2013-12-04 10:26:44",
      "stars": "4"
    },
    {
      "reviewbody": "Great job! Love hearing the crowd getting into it (how could they not with Peter Rowan there?). New songs debuted, Railroad Earth encore. I'd be plumb happy with either of these sets, but both in the same night? Thanks for capturing the magic. ",
      "reviewtitle": "Yessir!!",
      "reviewer": "eyesaweabyrd",
      "reviewdate": "2013-12-04 12:08:54",
      "createdate": "2013-12-04 12:08:54",
      "stars": "4"
    }
  ]
